[{"title":"指定精确平台名称","code":"tool=\"$WM_PROJECT_DIR/wmake/scripts/wcleanObjects\"\ndemoProject=$(mktemp -d \"$HOME/foam-clean-build.XXXXXX\")\nmkdir -p \"$demoProject/build/linux64GccDPInt32Opt\"\n(cd \"$demoProject\" && WM_PROJECT_DIR=\"$demoProject\" \"$tool\" linux64GccDPInt32Opt)","explanation":"处理指定名称及源码规则允许的同前缀目录。"},{"title":"选择一个编译器系列","code":"tool=\"$WM_PROJECT_DIR/wmake/scripts/wcleanObjects\"\ndemoProject=$(mktemp -d \"$HOME/foam-clean-build.XXXXXX\")\nmkdir -p \"$demoProject/build/${WM_ARCH}GccDPInt32Opt\"\n(cd \"$demoProject\" && WM_PROJECT_DIR=\"$demoProject\" \"$tool\" -compiler=Gcc)","explanation":"-compiler=Gcc 选择当前 WM_ARCH 加 Gcc 前缀的构建目录。"},{"title":"同时清理两个配置","code":"tool=\"$WM_PROJECT_DIR/wmake/scripts/wcleanObjects\"\ndemoProject=$(mktemp -d \"$HOME/foam-clean-build.XXXXXX\")\nmkdir -p \"$demoProject/build\"/{configA,configB}\n(cd \"$demoProject\" && WM_PROJECT_DIR=\"$demoProject\" \"$tool\" configA configB)","explanation":"输入可给出多个平台目录名，分别处理。"},{"title":"清除整个演示构建树","code":"tool=\"$WM_PROJECT_DIR/wmake/scripts/wcleanObjects\"\ndemoProject=$(mktemp -d \"$HOME/foam-clean-build.XXXXXX\")\nmkdir -p \"$demoProject/build/configA\"\n(cd \"$demoProject\" && WM_PROJECT_DIR=\"$demoProject\" \"$tool\" all)","explanation":"直接调用 wcleanObjects 默认目标是 build；all 移除整个演示 build。"}]